. 
. * generate average
. tsset lnr year

Panel variable: lnr (unbalanced)
 Time variable: year, 1995 to 2015, but with gaps
         Delta: 1 unit

. 
. forval j = 0/$NN  {
  2.         qui gen ${dependent_var}_d`j' = (f`j'.${dependent_var} - l1.${dependent_var})
  3.         }

